> Trace the actual5068-value compact model

The two-tap ingress contributes2052 values; five joined gate projections360,
five skip projections200, four residual projections80, post projection72 and
head2304. Total5068 values in34 leaves. Kernels use the source Glorot uniform
radius sqrt(6/(kernel×(in+out))), biases zero, native initializer seed541.
The last block omits its unused residual projection. The traced composite
block below groups the executed five-block skip path; exact output shapes and
all learned values come from the real forward computation.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/wv_network.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){
 namespace n=dm::nn;namespace m=n::models;m::WaveStackConfig c{4,8,5,1,256};n::ParameterStore p(541);
 n::Module model([&](const n::Tensor& x){auto out=m::WaveStack(p,x,c);
  n::model_stage("5 gated blocks / dilations1,2,4,8,16",x,out.skip);
  return n::model_stage("ReLU / post / ReLU /256-code head",out.skip,out.logits);
 },"Generative WaveNet:5068 stored values, RF33");
 n::ModelPlotOptions options;options.detail=n::ModelPlotDetail::Blocks;options.sizing.minimum_extent=1;options.sizing.max_planes=4;
 auto figure=model.plot(n::zeros({1,64,256}),options);
 if(figure.parameter_count()!=5068||p.size()!=34)throw std::runtime_error("Actual source census");
 figure.save_svg("build/wv_network.svg");
}
