> Inspect all three held-out reference code sequences

These inverse-codebook waveforms show all384 reference codes of each held-out
prompt, at the real8kHz time scale. Case0/1/2 receives a vertical display offset
0/2.5/5, disclosed on the axis; the offset is never applied to audio or model
inputs. The observed prefix is16ms, while the original384-code reference lasts
48ms. Source IDs are retained in the legend and archive.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/wv_reference.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
