> Verify the exact input receptive field and future exclusion

The saved structural fixture differentiates logit[0,48,0] with respect to the
entire continuous encoded input[1,64,256]. All16384 partials remain available.
Every time before16 or after48 is exactly zero; at least one partial inside
16..48 is nonzero. That is RF33 in observed codes and excludes target future.
Separately, every actual code from t128 onward is changed by+71 modulo256
in all24 test windows; all earlier predictions must remain bit identical.
These finite interventions complement a derivative check that alone could
vanish through inactive ReLUs. No attribution or causal-inference claim is made.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/wv_causality.png", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
