> Check the cache against the full33-code computation

The plot retains all369 probe errors, without averaging by case or dropping
zeros. First162 probes come from the two cold streams; the last207 from three
prompt streams. Both compare all256 head logits at each probe. Magnitudes are
scaled by10^8 only for readable axes; stored errors remain in original units.
The full independent NumPy audit goes further: it recomputes every one of5632
sampled heads from actual RF33 contexts and reproduces every sampled code.

